==Strategy==
This stage has a variety of Red, Alien, and Zombie, specifically [[Zuche]] and [[Cyberhorn]] being tough enemies. It is recommended to bring strong ranged anti-Zombie Cats, such as [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Gardener]] Cat or  [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Vaulter]] Cat, as well as anti-Alien/Red like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Surfer]], [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Wheel]], or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hip Hop]].

